{"id":"13e4a40da6a20a5c","group":"20","path":"20/20-lem-black-restriction.md","title":"黑节点限制产生全黑子树","display":"lem-black-restriction — 黑节点限制产生全黑子树","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-lem-black-restriction","aliases":["20-lem-black-restriction"],"display":"lem-black-restriction — 黑节点限制产生全黑子树","chapter":"12","section":"12.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§12.4 Case 1","source_printed_pages":[201],"source_pdf_pages":[231],"depends_on":["[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","[[20-df-on-function-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-lem-black-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-lem-black-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-black-restriction — 黑节点限制产生全黑子树"},{"key":"chapter","html":"12"},{"key":"section","html":"12.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§12.4 Case 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>201</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>231</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 全可计算函数树；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T)\">\\(\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f2458da73bd8fe19\" href=\"?note=f2458da73bd8fe19\" title=\"20-df-e-colored-node\">20-df-e-colored-node</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"37dcefa1c874faab\" href=\"?note=37dcefa1c874faab\" title=\"20-df-on-function-tree\">20-df-on-function-tree</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black-restriction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T_\\nu,e)\\quad\\land\\quad T_\\nu\\subseteq_f T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black-restriction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T_\\nu,e)\\quad\\land\\quad T_\\nu\\subseteq_f T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>限制仍全定义；其每个节点和延伸都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 上且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 之上。任何分裂都会同时是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 上方的分裂，矛盾。固定根的域串可写入程序。</p>\n<p>来源：§12.4 Case 1；印刷页 201；PDF 第 231 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-e-colored-node]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-on-function-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-e-colored-node","status":"resolved","id":"f2458da73bd8fe19","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-on-function-tree","status":"resolved","id":"37dcefa1c874faab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-e-colored-node]]；see [[20-df-on-function-tree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BlackNode}_e(\\nu,T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}black-restriction}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{EBlack}(T_\\nu,e)\\quad\\land\\quad T_\\nu\\subseteq_f T.","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false}],"bytes":1138,"backlinks":[{"id":"cb6a5dd98b8b185b","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-splitting-procedure]]；see [[20-lem-black-restriction]]；see [[20-lem-splitting-totality]]；see [[20-lem-color-inheritance]]。"}],"outgoing":["f2458da73bd8fe19","37dcefa1c874faab"]}